{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32454","headline":"和徐商贺卢员外赐绯 · 段成式","name":"和徐商贺卢员外赐绯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云雨轩悬莺语新，一篇佳句占阳春。\n银黄年少偏欺酒，金紫风流不让人。\n连璧座中斜日满，贯珠歌里落花频。\n莫辞倒载吟归去，看欲东山又吐茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}